# ============================================================================
# AVAHUI MONOREPO — .dockerignore
# ============================================================================

# Git & Version Control
.git
.gitignore
.github

# Dependencies & Build Artifacts (rebuilt inside container)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/cache
**/broadcast
**/coverage
**/.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo

# Environment & Secret Files (injected at runtime via docker-compose / orchestrator)
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.secret

# Local Database Volumes & Backups
postgres_data
pgdata
infrastructure/database/backups/*

# Documentation, Tests & IDE Configs
docs
README.md
**/*.md
**/test
**/tests
**/__tests__
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
playwright-report
test-results
.vscode
.idea

# OS Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
